قادر یَاہوِہ۔","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"آپ کے قوانین پائدار ہیں،","poem":1},{"text":"اَے یَاہوِہ، ابدُالآباد تک؛","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"تقدُّس آپ کے گھر کی زینت ہے۔","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/urd_oucv/PSA/93.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/urd_oucv/PSA/94.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/urd_oucv/PSA/92.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}